DTSTAMP:20260829T210921
UID:9277555-372525068
SEQUENCE:5
DESCRIPTION:Location: Salem Ice Center\n HI everyone\,\n\nGood news and ba
 d news. \n\nGood news : We are celebrating Cody's 12th birthday at 1:45 wi
 th pizza and cake !!! \nBad news: there are no teams available to scrimmag
 e so we are going to take advantage of the ice time at 2:45. The team will
  learn a new pre-warm up routine and then have some fun with 3 v 3 or 4 v 
 4 !!  (Arrival Time:  1:45 PM (Eastern Time (US & Canada))) 
LAST-MODIFIED:20260829T210921
LOCATION:60 Lowell Rd\nSalem NH 03079\nUnited States
END:VEVENT
